  rcases le_or_gt s (15/32 : ℝ) with d3 | d3
  · right; right; right; left; exact ⟨d2g, d3⟩
  rcases lt_or_ge s (17/32 : ℝ) with g3 | d3g
  · exact absurd hF (gapL14567_3 s d3 g3)
  rcases le_or_gt s (31/56 : ℝ) with d4 | d4
